# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# A force tolerance for the minimizer on a GPU in mixed precision
# (D219), Inputs/python_minimize_tolerance.py: `[minimize]
# force_tolerance` of `mdir run` against a NumPy reference of the criterion
# on its rows, a run without the key of as many steps, and
# `Simulation.minimize(tolerance=...)` stopping at the same step.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_minimize_tolerance.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir %t Mixed | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: GPU Mixed: mdir run stops at step 100 (NumPy reference 100)
# CHECK: GPU Mixed: not converged after 20 steps at 1 kcal/mol/A; converged at step 0 at 30
# CHECK: GPU Mixed: Python stops at step 100, converged
# CHECK: minimization tolerance mixed passed
